@title: cross_page_journey
@context: One visitor goes through every part of the site in a row.
@tags: navigation
@import: * from '../lib/env.hunt'

STEP 1: Open home
    NAVIGATE to 'Home'
    VERIFY that the page is 'Home'

STEP 2: Sign in
    CLICK the 'Login page' link
    SET {user} = ada
    SET {password} = lovelace
    USE Login.SignIn
    VERIFY that 'Welcome, ada' is present

STEP 3: To the shop
    CLICK the 'Home' link
    CLICK the 'Shop' link ON HEADER
    VERIFY that the page is 'Shop'

STEP 4: Buy a plush
    SET {product} = Manul Plush
    USE Shop.Add
    VERIFY that 'Cart: 1' is present

STEP 5: Sign up
    CLICK the 'Home' link
    CLICK the 'Sign-up form' link
    SET {name} = Ada Lovelace
    SET {email} = ada@example.com
    USE Signup.Fill
    USE Signup.Submit
    VERIFY that 'Thanks, Ada Lovelace! Plan: free, country: Choose…, newsletter: yes' is present

STEP 6: Hover the avatar
    CLICK the 'Home' link
    CLICK the 'Mouse and keyboard' link
    HOVER over the 'Avatar'
    VERIFY that 'Signed in as Manul' is present

STEP 7: Read a quote
    CLICK the 'Home' link
    CLICK the 'Quote of the day' link
    VERIFY that 'Simple things should be simple.' is present

DONE.
